      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "在已接入 PCConfig 的 AI 对话里直接说想核对哪一类机器事实，例如“核心恢复”“计划任务”“运行时版本”；需要修复时另说明目标。",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "40%"
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "需要准备什么",
        "row": "start",
        "icon_position": "header_left",
        "header_icon": "_library/hires-icons/icon-clean-0432a3e02a060c22b01c.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "从开始到拿到结果",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "60%",
        "heading_icon": "_library/icons/scene-r3-exact-three-stairs.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. **找到负责的入口**　AI 先判断这次决定依赖哪一类事实，直接用那一类自己的只读检查，不再走统一验收器。",
        "row": "start",
        "columns": 1,
